# Lite-On's LTST-C190GKT: a 0603 green LED on GaP. The datasheet (DS-22-98-0011, revision H)
# states a peak wavelength of 565 nm, a dominant wavelength of 569 nm, a DC forward current of
# 30 mA, a reverse voltage of 5 V and a power dissipation of 100 mW.

kind         part
